Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||10-10-2000||11:00 PM||||Can anyone recommend a good web host that has a reseller package? I've been having a few service problems with my current provider, so I'm looking for a new one.<P>thanks!<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||5
Z||000001||mbramble||10-11-2000||01:06 PM||||Try <A HREF="http://www.idesigns.net." TARGET=_blank>http://www.idesigns.net.</A>   Don't know much about the reseller part but they definitely have great service.  I have had my family history website (www.bramblett.com) with them for over 2 years and don't think it has been down more than a couple minutes total other than for a couple of planned upgrades.  I honestly don't believe that I have ever waited more than a half hour before getting a response to an e-mailed question -- and normally less than 10 minutes!!  They are great!!!  There is also phone support but that may depend on the account you get.  I have what was called the 'mini' package -- 100MB, 3G transfer, PHP3, MySQL, 100 POP accounts, and on and on and on for $20/month.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Songman||10-12-2000||12:33 AM||||I use several different ones... Highway Technologies is good... <A HREF="http://www.hiway.net" TARGET=_blank>www.hiway.net</A> <BR>They are one of the biggest companies around.<P>The newest one I am using is called ServerCental. They are a newer hosting company but I have had great success with them. They have plans as low as $7 per month and can tailor them to your needs. <A HREF="http://www.servercentral.net" TARGET=_blank>www.servercentral.net</A> <BR>If you want to give ServerCental a shot, send and e-mail to Jordan Lowe at sales@servercentral.net and tell him I referred you.<P>Good luck.||||reg||1
